  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Dong Fang Yi Kong opens his palm and shows a miniature mountain peak in vibrant colored light.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_yi_kong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When northern plains righteous path Gu Immortals ask how to swear an oath in Jade Pool Blessed Land, which has no mountains or rivers, Dong Fang Yi Kong reveals that miniature peak. Murong Qing Si names it Miniscule Mountain, and Dong Fang Yi Kong confirms it.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land",
        "char_murong_qing_si"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miniscule Mountain is the paradise and foundation of minimen, recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu. It is small but a genuine mountain that needs large amounts of earth qi to stabilize its form, so Gu Immortals cannot casually keep it in an aperture for long. It is not the private possession of any Dong Fang tribe Gu Immortal and is placed in Jade Pool blessed land most of the time for that earth qi supply.",
      "chapters": [
        799
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "miniman-foundation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under an agreement, a miniman Gu Immortal flies Miniscule Mountain to shield Dong Fang Yu Liang, a will that has seized control of Dong Fang Chang Fan’s body, from the band of demons’ attacks. By the fighting’s later stage, Miniscule Mountain is full of cracks and shedding rock while still in flight.",
      "chapters": [
        803
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shielding-dong-fang-yu-liang",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_minimen",
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By the time Fang Yuan takes City Well, Miniscule Mountain has already been removed from it and destroyed in Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        1489
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "removed-from-city-well-and-destroyed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_city_well",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Legends of Ren Zu records Miniscule Mountain among secluded domains of heaven and earth under rule path with Reverse Flow River and Cheng Bai Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        2099
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
